# Blob dumps permitted inside log macros -- see scripts/ci/check_log_blob_dumps.py
#
# Format, tab-separated:   path <TAB> whitespace-normalized argument <TAB> reason
#
# The reason states the BOUND, not an opinion. "Reviewed" and "intentional"
# are not bounds; "fixed 32 bytes" is. If you cannot name the bound, the
# argument is not bounded and the site needs describe_peer_blob() instead.
#
# Keyed on the argument text, never on a line number, so the row survives
# edits above it and dies when the argument itself changes -- which is right,
# because the bound is a property of the argument.
